From 7cd7ffde80dbd8ad9f33bdbe8c685c03f657ec01 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mathias <77238760+MathiasMortus@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 13:50:09 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 57/60] Glint: favicons on command palette history rows

History and profile-history rows start with the generic clock glyph and
swap to the site's favicon as FaviconService lookups resolve (matched
back by URL; profile rows query their own profile's favicon database).
---
 .../resources/glint_ui/assets/styles.css      |  2 +-
 .../browser/resources/glint_ui/sidepanel.js   |  2 +-
 .../ui/views/glint/glint_command_palette.cc   | 48 +++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 50 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/chrome/browser/resources/glint_ui/assets/styles.css b/chrome/browser/resources/glint_ui/assets/styles.css
index ee35ec1ec3..025f86de51 100644
--- a/chrome/browser/resources/glint_ui/assets/styles.css
+++ b/chrome/browser/resources/glint_ui/assets/styles.css
